# Delta

#T#Math#= **Delta** is a math workspace in the ribbon style, or in its original Delta Classic look. It has a live graphing calculator, a LaTeX renderer and a calculator!

[Open Delta](/delta) · [Phone version](/delta/mobile/)

| Tab | Use it for |
| --- | --- |
| #O.torpedo(Graph) | Plot equations as you type. Add #B.capsule(sliders) for values you want to change, use #B.capsule(lists), and draw #B.capsule(polygons) |
| #GL.torpedo(LaTeX) | Write LaTeX and see it drawn, ready to copy into a document |
| #Y.torpedo(Calculator) | Everyday and scientific calculations |
| #L.torpedo(Share) | Share & Chat, for working on a graph together |

::tip Math in documents
Writeout, Bitbook and OpenDB draw math from `$x^2$` and `$$ ... $$`, using KaTeX. Delta's LaTeX tab is a good place to try an equation before pasting it!
::end
